# A guard for the struct and enum siblings: a runtime construction whose
# compile-time value is a shell with an unknown leaf used to read as a folded
# constant, so the PARAM-STORAGE mask skipped it, never saw the push, and
# dropped the method's entry assert. The tuple shape asserted before that fix
# too; the fix's `value_contains_unknown` now also looks inside tuple values,
# and this case pins that the method still carries the assert and panics.
# `build run` propagates the panic as rc≠0.
